From 69594a35883b1080a798c19dfd48a3bcfa4277b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joe <joe@n9tax.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:06:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Backspace and DEL both erase (tty and levee: terminals send
 one or the other); levee: arrow keys (ESC [ A..D, ESC O A..D) move like k j l
 h, end an insert first, are ignored on the : line

---
 Applications/levee/globals.c  |  2 +-
 Applications/levee/insert.c   |  4 +++
 Applications/levee/misc.c     |  7 +++-
 Applications/levee/unixcall.c | 68 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 Kernel/tty.c                  |  6 +++-
 5 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

